# Which cmd-shims checks this repository runs, where a reviewer sees it.
#
# This repo is public and holds the record that says a control is only as wide
# as the paths it mediates. A pull-request body or a branch name typed here
# reaches a public API without passing a single git hook, so the guards that
# cover that path are named here rather than assumed.
no-os-identity
prevent-ai-author
prevent-unusual-unicode
